      <TableCell><code>podAffinityTerm</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Defines a set of pods (namely those matching the labelSelector relative to the given namespace(s)) that this pod should be co-located (affinity) or not co-located (anti-affinity) with, where co-located is defined as running on a node whose value of the label with key &lt;topologyKey&gt; matches that of any node on which a pod of the set of pods is running</TableCell>
