      <h3 id="_templatespecephemeralcontainersvolumemounts" class="group scroll-mt-20">.template.spec.ephemeralContainers[].volumeMounts<a href="#_templatespecephemeralcontainersvolumemounts" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Pod volumes to mount into the container’s filesystem. Subpath mounts are not allowed for ephemeral containers. Cannot be updated.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
