      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>name</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>If specified, this must be an IANA_SVC_NAME and unique within the pod. Each named port in a pod must have a unique name. Name for the port that can be referred to by services.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>protocol</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Protocol for port. Must be UDP, TCP, or SCTP. Defaults to "TCP".<Fragment set:html={"<br>"} />Possible enum values:  - <code>"SCTP"</code> is the SCTP protocol.  - <code>"TCP"</code> is the TCP protocol.  - <code>"UDP"</code> is the UDP protocol.</TableCell>
