      <h3 id="_templatespecvolumespersistentvolumeclaim" class="group scroll-mt-20">.template.spec.volumes[].persistentVolumeClaim<a href="#_templatespecvolumespersistentvolumeclaim" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>PersistentVolumeClaimVolumeSource references the user’s PVC in the same namespace. This volume finds the bound PV and mounts that volume for the pod. A PersistentVolumeClaimVolumeSource is, essentially, a wrapper around another type of volume that is owned by someone else (the system).</p></dd>
