      <TableCell>Select all ClusterTrustBundles that match this label selector.  Only has effect if signerName is set.  Mutually-exclusive with name.  If unset, interpreted as "match nothing".  If set but empty, interpreted as "match everything".</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
