      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>storageMode</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>storageMode indicates whether the storage for a volume should be ThickProvisioned or ThinProvisioned. Default is ThinProvisioned.</TableCell>
